NP.TXT:
That question has been raised in proceedings between Michel Macon and other persons, members of the Groupement Agricole d'Exploitation en Commun (collective farming group) du Canada in Ardon (the
          GAEC du Canada
          ) and the Préfet de l'Aisne concerning payment of compensation for definitive discontinuation of milk production for the marketing year 1991/92.
